flowchart LR
  I[PNG/JPG/GeoTIFF] --> V[Safe validation + RGB]
  V --> L[Load DAV2 Large exact revision]
  L --> Q{Large image?}
  Q -->|No| P[CUDA/autocast prediction]
  Q -->|Yes| T[Bounded overlap tiles]
  T --> A[Positive affine overlap alignment]
  A --> B[Feather blend raw field]
  P --> R[raw_model_output.npy]
  B --> R
  R --> C[Declared direction + one robust normalization]
  C --> S[relative_surface.npy]
  S --> D[Display-only cleanup]
  D --> G[GLB/viewer]
  S --> E[Provenance + possible calibration]

